IMPROPERS
!
!V(improper) = Kpsi(psi - psi0)**2
!
!Kpsi: kcal/mole/rad**2
!psi0: degrees
!note that the second column of numbers (0) is ignored
!
!atom types           Kpsi                   psi0
!

!backbone N-C-CA-H 
NH1   X     X     H      45.00    0     0.0
!backbone C-CA-N-O
C     X     X     O     100.00    0     0.0
!CA-N-C-CB improper => amino acid chirality
C1E   X     X     C3E    55.00    0     35.3   ! ala
C1E   X     X     A2V    55.00    0     35.3   ! val
C1E   X     X     A1L    55.00    0     35.3   ! leu
